{
  "id": "MAT.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 18",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida haweewa sean ng'eaha?",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida gaweay giinealanga heeda Yesu ak ghoanyaash gideaba “Siida haweewa sean ng'eaha aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa niny baleanda ak ghwanung' ghamiinaada aba dageascheeda nyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi, “Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, Iimoayami geat ea awuurjeewana diibiga, ea majaghanyi aweayeena jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean aat geaw ng'eanyi ea gawuurji jeebi, siisi siida haw gil aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida wassean jea ghamwas jeabwagi uurji nih aba gheawungeasu, abeeda ghamwasan aniini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simsimda eadu riing'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean jea ghwanung' gwasin riing'eeda jeabwagi aba jeedeaba diibisu manang'i mwasaniin, ghang'wana gwachi geerasa gheata lagheaneeda haw bea ng'ealdeayda ak geejaksa bugusta basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eamuy daang'u ng'eanyiida aba simsimda eatu riing'eeda! Aba gideaba simsimda gammiisa hinnooda, abeeda eamuy dea siida jea ghwanung' ghwahidu simsimda! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinung' geatindaang'u adiinya ghanea geashtaang'u, laja ak gijakti asheagiidana geaw; ghang'wana ginyasi eaweega nea gibea badeeda, mwasamwa gideaba gindeawi geatin iyeenya ea geeshan iyeenya ak geejakseey jeeda beasta manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama nung' gheang'daang'u sina riing'eeda giloati, ak gijakti asheagiidana geaw; ghang'wana gideaba ginyasi eaweega nea gibea ghaang'agi, mwasamwa gideaba gindeawi gheanyan iyeenya, ak geejakseey jeeda beasta maloonghajeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gissigala gisilleanda roat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'ula! Adiidu goofooli earagi aba jeedeaba suh manang'iin, asi geayeeshiineegwa aba humng'eeda malaykajeega nyaawa iissa gang'ula galeagasean gheamamda Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Orjeeda Siida ghoan gwalealu gidaghayi roat.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gawuurjiin? Siida iimideawa gisil bughala, ak ghwaroat agi, maygwanung'usa heeda giika aseedam ea damashageashiin uhuuda giijeeda ak gawa gagasa diita gwachi roadiin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu nea ghwanyas, aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, gaygang'weeliisa nih muuchi ea ghwalaabwa hoowa giika aseedam ea damashageash marootean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi nih mii gidagasiida Ghweandeang'wa mida humng'eeda gideaba gayghwaroat jeabwagi aba jeedeaba suh manang'iin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iyadiiyseey orjeeda giyeang'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyadiiyseey orjeeda giyeang'wa, guweesi ak gireekusi nea goobeayi geat. Iimwas gooleeyseey iita abeeda ea ninyasi orjeeda giyeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama heawa gooleeyseey iit giideayeewi siyagi ghanea fih iyeenya sea ang'iing'i, aba gideaba ng'asheanda wassean iirugu aba madeeda muushoodi asiyeenya ghanea samwagu abeeda ng'asheega gaygamajeekcheewiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama mealeeysiiniit saawa, abeeda girukusi ganiisa; ama mealeeysiiniit ganiisa, abeeda ginung' ghoah aba headaang'u siida Eemoojiga ea dea ang'waanyi gwaadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeheeweega ea giidaydeayda gheata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, gida wassean oarachi aba hiji bea ng'eanyiidean abeeda gajea sirat aba hoowa bea humng'eedean, nea gidootiinyi aba hiji bea ng'eanyiidean gajea siitin aba hoowa bea humng'eedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshiineegwa gicha, aba jeedeang'wa iineajeesa fih iyeenya ng'ashaan aba hiji bea badayda ng'eanyiidean ak ghamwaash ASEETA, gayghoadaw Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba heeda wassean roonyeesa fih iyeenya ghana samwagu aba gheawungeasu, abeeda eara aniini gaydanda jeenyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gissigala soomjeanda mandeawana samsiinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gawa Betaro heeda ak ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida, heapi orjeeda giyeanya iyadiiysean gaydasamsa niba hada? Niba ispwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Meayeeshiineey niba ispwa, eara laadam ea damanamughuush niba ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba deascheani sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda gawuurji sea sugoocheanjagi gasa gwayiida haleanjeeda sea soomjoagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ang'eat iitooda haleanjeeda, deagheata geeyeadu headaanyi siisi mideewa siileemba lapiyeeda siguura dalaantaji sagalamnyooji damanamughuush; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siisi abeeda mandeawana eara gichea ghoadaydaawa siileedida; iidu gwayeesha siidida haw was sugoocheandean, ashaayda niny ea gatmoadaanyi ea diibigaaschi ea haleanjeadaanyi sean mideawa, ak geataydaawa siileedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Soomjeandida ak gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, ‘Ng'utamiida, eaniyean nyooh ghanyi riyeang'da ak gaydawalu siileadaang'u sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghabwayda sugoocheanda soomjeandida ak gwasamsa siileedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa soomjeandida ak gwaroonyi sea siyagi was soomjeanda eawoojisu mideaydooscheesa gadiyeeda biissa gwandeawa siileadaanyi lapiyaji bughala siguura dinaari. Gang'eesa ak ghoang'waay ak ghoagheat nea gwayeesha, ‘Goona siileedeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwatkuy aba madeadaanyi siidida eawoojisu mideaydooschi aba gadiyeedean ak gamus nea gwayeesha, ‘Eaniyean nyooh ghanyi riyeang'da ak gaydawalu siileadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaheawa ak gwajaksa ghealooniga ea eaghus ea niwalu siileedida.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah soomjooga mideaydooschi ng'asheanji gwanyareesi muuchi, ak gaweay gwarukusa siida bea gadiyeeda iiteaba ng'asheesu sean Sini siidideani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa siidida bea gadiyeedean ak gwayeesha, ‘Ea soomjeanda muy! Gwachi ang'iing'i gimuschean gideaba eaniyean nyooh ghanyi bassean ak geasamseey siileedida sean itaang'uun; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ang'iing'i mamiiseey gideaba gaybwayda soomjeanda indeaydooscheesi gadiyeeda gawuurji gidagwachi easamsiindaneeyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyareas Siidida haw bea gadiyeedean muuchi ak ghwanung' eayaat eesawan ea eaghus ea niwalu siileedida seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu eara Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda gaygwahinduneegwa eara agooga iimaba siisi samsa orjeeda geanyaawa aba jeadaanyi sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
